reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 2 has the label "Regulation 648/2012, Article 1(6), rule 2".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 2 has the modality obligation.

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 2 has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_80214a02".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 2 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2012/648/art_1/par_6/2025-01-17".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 2 produces reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 action 2.

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 2 has the legal text "To that end, by 17 November 2012 the Commission shall present to the European Parliament and the Council a report assessing the international treatment of public bodies charged with or intervening in the management of the public debt and central banks.".


reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 is identified by "https://system.org/example#REG2012648ART1PAR6_Rule3".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 is a prescriptive rule.

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 has the label "Regulation 648/2012, Article 1(6), rule 3".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 has the modality obligation.

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_80214a02".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2012/648/art_1/par_6/2025-01-17".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 produces reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 action 3.

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 3 has the legal text "The report shall include a comparative analysis of the treatment of those bodies and of central banks within the legal framework of a significant number of third countries, including at least the three most important jurisdictions as regards volumes of contracts traded, and the risk-management standards applicable to the derivative transactions entered into by those bodies and by central banks in those jurisdictions.".


