reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 4 is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2012/648/art_1/par_6/2025-01-17".

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 4 produces reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 action 4.

reg 2012648 art 1 par 6 rule 4 has the legal text "If the report concludes that the exemption of the monetary responsibilities of those third-country central banks from the clearing and reporting obligation is necessary, the Commission shall add them to the list set out in paragraph 4.".


